{"about_the_game":"Sent by the Church to investigate strange cases of possession, explore the universe of Baphomet, where numerous areas await you, such as the Templars' Dungeon, the Village, the Catacombs, and many more! Roam through each location and search every nook and cranny to unveil all the secrets hidden within the game!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/CouloirGIF_02.gif?t=1711695119\" /><br><br>Exorcise your enemies and collect Latin words that you can pronounce at the Altar to enhance your skills!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/ExorcismeGIF_02.gif?t=1711695119\" /><br><br>Baphomet is an action game with combat mechanics. Master the art of the Redeemer to neutralize your adversaries, then bestow your blessing when they are at your feet, helpless before your divine power!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/RedeemerBlessGIF_02.gif?t=1711695119\" /><br><br>Carefully scan your environment; many objects could prove useful in facing your enemies!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/PorteProvidenceGIF_02.gif?t=1711695119\" /><br><br>Discover formulas, then utter the final words of your victims to learn new skills<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/GainCompetenceGIF.gif?t=1711695119\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2673800?t=1711695119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1711695119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1711695119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1711695119","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Sent by the Church to investigate strange cases of possession, explore the universe of Baphomet, where numerous areas await you, such as the Templars' Dungeon, the Village, the Catacombs, and many more! Roam through each location and search every nook and cranny to unveil all the secrets hidden within the game!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/CouloirGIF_02.gif?t=1711695119\" /><br><br>Exorcise your enemies and collect Latin words that you can pronounce at the Altar to enhance your skills!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/ExorcismeGIF_02.gif?t=1711695119\" /><br><br>Baphomet is an action game with combat mechanics. Master the art of the Redeemer to neutralize your adversaries, then bestow your blessing when they are at your feet, helpless before your divine power!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/RedeemerBlessGIF_02.gif?t=1711695119\" /><br><br>Carefully scan your environment; many objects could prove useful in facing your enemies!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/PorteProvidenceGIF_02.gif?t=1711695119\" /><br><br>Discover formulas, then utter the final words of your victims to learn new skills<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673800/extras/GainCompetenceGIF.gif?t=1711695119\" />","developers":["M\u00e9lancolie Diabolique"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"des